  "updated_at": "2026-03-21",
  "bio": "Renowned for his intricate fineline, black & gray, and sketch style tattoos, Julien l'Apostat is a highly skilled artist based in Toulouse, France. His keen attention to detail and artistry are evident in every piece he creates, making him a sought-after tattooer among enthusiasts. Clients admire his professionalism and dedication to his craft, demonstrated through his exceptional work and client interactions.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Toulouse, Occitanie, France"
}